---
// Project: ORBIT. Labels and their sources:
//   SEMANTIC MODEL, YAML · Brick  README: "a unified YAML (and Brick Schema) converter that generates each building's
//                                  config files from a single semantic building model"
//   configuration converter       README architecture table, "Configuration converter"; ORNL/TM-2026/4715 section 2.1
//   PLATFORM                      README: "an open-source, scalable software platform" (heading wording is ours)
//   VOLTTRON                      README: "Middleware ... VOLTTRON"
//   device drivers                README: "Device servers ... Device drivers (ecobee, eGauge, Schneider, Modbus)"
//   web application               README: "web application for real-time monitoring, time-series visualization, and
//                                  supervisory control"
//   BACnet · Modbus               README: "Vendor-agnostic device integration over the open BACnet and Modbus protocols"
//   BUILDING, thermostats, meters TM-4715 section 2.2.2: "smart thermostats, IoT environmental sensors, and energy meters"
// Illustrative, not from the sources: the building's form and where its devices sit.
// Style C, exploded axonometric (approved style sheet, diagram-styles.html), sized for the project card:
// the drawing group is scaled, the labels are not. Classes: .dgc in global.css.
---
